# InsightFlow Project Intelligence

## Project Context
- 90-day personal brand and product launch journey
- SaaS application focused on data analytics and insights
- Being built with limited time (4-5 hours daily) alongside full-time job
- Following Hormozi-style efficiency principles

## Development Patterns
- Next.js with TypeScript for modern web development
- App Router structure for page organization
- tRPC for type-safe API communication
- Prisma for database operations
- ShadCN UI components for consistent design
- Documentation-to-content pipeline for efficient content creation

## Workflow Preferences
- 25-minute focused development sprints with 5-minute documentation periods
- Weekend acceleration blocks for major progress
- Tasks prioritized by impact and matched to energy levels
- Ruthless feature prioritization for MVP
- Content creation directly from development documentation

## Critical Implementation Paths
- Authentication system using NextAuth.js
- Dashboard with analytics widgets
- Data visualization components
- User management functionality
- Integration with external data sources

## Known Challenges
- Limited development time due to full-time employment
- Balancing feature development with content creation
- Maintaining focus on essential MVP features only
- Converting technical documentation into engaging content

This intelligence document will be updated as new patterns and preferences emerge during the project. 